From: Mohamad Al-Jaf <mohamadaljaf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.ui: Stub IUISettings2::get_TextScaleFactor().

Backported from WineHQ commit f19a7df7c0 (wine-11.1) without code
changes. The upstream test update is omitted.

Windows reports a text scale factor between 1.0 and 2.25. The base
returned E_NOTIMPL, which C++/WinRT callers turn into an exception; an
uncaught one ends the process during start-up. Report the default 1.0.

diff --git a/dlls/windows.ui/uisettings.c b/dlls/windows.ui/uisettings.c
--- a/dlls/windows.ui/uisettings.c
+++ b/dlls/windows.ui/uisettings.c
@@ -235,7 +235,8 @@ DEFINE_IINSPECTABLE( uisettings2, IUISettings2, struct uisettings, IUISettings_i
 static HRESULT WINAPI uisettings2_get_TextScaleFactor( IUISettings2 *iface, DOUBLE *value )
 {
     FIXME( "iface %p, value %p stub!\n", iface, value );
-    return E_NOTIMPL;
+    *value = 1.0;
+    return S_OK;
 }
 
 static HRESULT WINAPI uisettings2_add_TextScaleFactorChanged( IUISettings2 *iface, ITypedEventHandler_UISettings_IInspectable *handler,
